<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44709" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπάρῠφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with a fine purple
			border</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίζωμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Aem.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			: as Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπάρυφος,
					ἡ</span>, <i>a fine
			garment</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nicostr.Com.
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				1.16.3
			</span></i>: neut.  pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπάρυφα,
					τά</span>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ez.</u>
				23.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>wearing such a garment</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. τις</span>
			<i>a grandee</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.346
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.57a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Somn.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Demon.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>pompous</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διηγήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.547e
				</span></i>
			; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. λόγοι</span>
			<i>equivocal, lascivious</i> stories, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				10.453a
			</span></i>.</div>
